    <title>医美新语第四期：主播Do脸大分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66782b1bd3fc5dd62774dfd2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66782b1bd3fc5dd62774dfd2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>•Hello 大家好，好久不见，我是马里奥。很开心能够在播客上和大家再次见面。</span></p><span></span><p><span>•本次播客的主题是主播们的do脸大分享：我和小西经常以及为什么做哪些项目/这些项目的注意事项是什么/我们do脸的Tips/不同地区do脸的区别（东亚/大陆/澳洲等）是什么？答案尽在本期播客啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>•下面是本次音频的重点时间线奥：</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">1:27</a>小西目前经常做的项目：光电类/填充类</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">2:00</a>面部填充/馒化脸的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">5:50</a> 我目前经常做的项目：光电水光/点阵/填充类</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">8:40</a>大健康范畴抗衰</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a>人类本质的体现—撞南墙哈哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a>各自做项目的注意事项/恢复期/国内外医美机构感受</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a>小八卦---针剂价格</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 国外医美do脸特点/需要注意哪些</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a>我们5.1假期do脸八卦</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a>国内外do脸考虑的重点</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a>关于恢复期的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a>MBTI之医美分类哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a>防晒！！提醒大家热源也会刺激皮肤导致反黑等反应！</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a>做水光之后我们的Tips(牛碱性表皮生长因子)</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 总结啦</span></p>]]></description>
